  "Used here: Each component represents one transverse wavevector.": "本课用途：每个分量对应一个横向波矢。",
  "Matrices, eigenvectors, and modes.": "矩阵、特征向量与模式。",
  "Recognize a basis expansion and Av = λv.": "理解基展开和 Av = λv。",
  "Used here: The film describes plane waves as eigenfunctions of free-space propagation.": "本课用途：短片将平面波描述为自由空间传播的本征函数。",
  "Need a refresher? Open the recommended reading.": "需要复习？打开推荐阅读材料。",
