  "1. At fixed wavelength, halving a slit’s width generally makes its far-field central band…": "1. 固定波长，将狭缝宽度减半，通常会使远场中央亮带…",
  "Narrower": "变窄",
  "Wider": "变宽",
  "Unchanged": "保持不变",
  "2. Doubling zero padding at fixed pixel spacing primarily…": "2. 固定像素间距，将零填充长度加倍，主要会…",
  "Moves periodic copies farther apart": "拉开周期副本之间的距离",
  "Doubles the highest represented frequency": "使最高可表示频率加倍",
  "Changes the optical wavelength": "改变光学波长",
  "3. For an evanescent component propagated forward, H is…": "3. 对于向前传播的倏逝分量，H 是…",
  "A unit-magnitude phase rotation": "模为 1 的相位旋转",
  "An exponentially decreasing factor": "指数衰减因子",
