  "The standalone notebook builds the model in small steps, draws the results, and checks the calculation against independent predictions. It runs on CPU using NumPy, SciPy, and Matplotlib. No repository clone, GPU, or external dataset is needed.": "独立运行的 Python 实验会逐步构建模型、绘制结果，并用独立预测检验计算。实验使用 NumPy、SciPy 和 Matplotlib，在 CPU 上运行，无需克隆仓库、使用 GPU 或下载外部数据集。",
  "Open in Colab ↗": "在 Colab 中打开 ↗",
