  "In Colab, sign in with a Google account and select Runtime → Run all. Save a copy in Drive to retain edits. Saved notebook outputs and downloadable PNG figures provide a fallback if Colab’s output frame cannot load.": "在 Colab 中登录 Google 账号，选择“代码执行程序 → 全部运行”（Runtime → Run all）。将副本保存到云端硬盘以保留修改。如果 Colab 的输出区域无法加载，可查看 Notebook 已保存的输出或下载 PNG 图表。",
  "A short lab report": "简短实验报告",
  "Compare two widths.": "比较两种宽度。",
  "Predict the ratio of far-field angular widths, then measure their first minima or central-band widths.": "先预测远场角宽度之比，再测量第一暗纹或中央亮带的宽度。",
  "Separate numerical errors.": "区分数值误差。",
  "Change padding and sample spacing independently. Explain which fixes wrap-around and which extends Nyquist.": "独立改变零填充与采样间距，说明哪个能减小周期回绕，哪个能提高奈奎斯特频率。",
  "Test an eigenfunction.": "检验一个本征函数。",
  "Propagate a single Fourier-grid plane wave and compare it with its analytic phase factor.": "传播一个与傅里叶网格对齐的平面波，并与解析相位因子比较。",
  "Compare your reasoning": "对照你的推理",
  "Compare two widths": "比较两种宽度",
  "Halving the slit width doubles the ideal far-field angular scale; a finite-distance pattern need not obey the far-field estimate exactly.": "狭缝宽度减半，理想远场的角尺度加倍；有限距离下的图案不一定严格遵循远场估计。",
  "Separate numerical errors": "区分数值误差",
  "Padding separates periodic replicas; smaller pixels represent higher spatial frequencies. Neither replaces checking convergence.": "零填充拉开周期副本之间的距离；更小的像素能够表示更高的空间频率。两者都不能代替收敛性检查。",
  "Test an eigenfunction": "检验一个本征函数",
  "A grid-aligned plane wave keeps its transverse shape. Its coefficient gains e^(i k_z z), and its norm stays constant when k_z is real.": "与网格对齐的平面波保持横向形状不变。它的系数乘以 e^(i k_z z)；当 k_z 为实数时，范数保持不变。",
  "Optional deeper extension": "可选深入拓展",
  "Build a 2D propagator, compare exact and paraxial transfer functions on the same grid, and repeat with smaller pixels and larger padding.": "构建二维传播器，在同一网格上比较精确传递函数与近轴近似，再用更小的像素和更大的零填充重复计算。",
  "The notebook marks the extension clearly. Complete the core experiment and its checks first.": "Notebook 中已明确标出拓展部分。请先完成核心实验及其检验。",
