  "The self-contained Python notebook reproduces the Airy profiles, builds a PSF from a pupil with an FFT, verifies the transfer function, and explores noisy deconvolution.": "独立运行的 Python 实验会重现艾里截面、通过 FFT 从瞳函数构建点扩散函数、验证传递函数，并探索含噪反卷积。",
