  ". No GitHub account, repository clone, GPU, or paid Colab plan is needed. To keep your edits, save a copy to your own Drive. You can also download the notebook for local Jupyter.": "。无需 GitHub 账号、克隆仓库、GPU 或付费 Colab 方案。若要保留修改，请将副本保存到自己的云端硬盘。也可以下载 Notebook，在本地 Jupyter 中运行。",
  "FROM APERTURE TO IMAGE": "从孔径到图像",
