  "The notebook makes the sampling, array layout, and periodic FFT boundary assumptions explicit.": "Notebook 会明确说明采样、数组排布和 FFT 周期边界的假设。",
  "MODEL, MATERIALS & SOURCES": "模型、材料与参考资料",
  "This is a scalar, monochromatic, shift-invariant model. It omits aberrations, vector polarization effects, defocus, finite emitters, detector pixel integration, and photon noise in the browser demo. High-NA behavior is illustrative; vector models may be needed for quantitative microscopy. The notebook introduces additive noise separately.": "这是标量、单色、平移不变模型。浏览器演示不包含像差、矢量偏振效应、离焦、有限尺寸发光体、探测器像素积分或光子噪声。高 NA 下的结果仅用于说明原理；定量显微成像可能需要矢量模型。Python 实验会单独引入加性噪声。",
